  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like an option in VRChat's settings to completely disable the on-screen keyboard.\n\nWhen using VRChat on desktop, I would prefer to type using my physical keyboard without the on-screen keyboard appearing.\n\nCurrently, the on-screen keyboard takes up a significant amount of screen space and can interfere with the chat experience.\n\nIt would be very helpful if users could choose whether to enable or disable the on-screen keyboard in the settings.\n\n**Suggested Feature:**\n\nAdd a toggle in the settings to enable or disable the on-screen keyboard, allowing desktop users to use their physical keyboard without the virtual keyboard appearing.",
